# The vendored gregale binary lands in this directory at release time.
# The release.yml workflow cross-builds ./cmd/gregale for linux-amd64
# (and optional darwin-arm64 for maintainer local dev), stamps the
# version via -ldflags -X .../pkg/wire.Version, and writes the result
# to bin/gregale. SHA256SUMS is generated alongside and attached to
# the GitHub Release.
#
# This file is a placeholder so the directory is tracked in git. The
# release workflow git-adds and commits the actual binary on every
# v*.*.* tag.
